{
  "_about": [
    "The command-line tools the panel can fetch by itself, at a fixed version, with the SHA-256 the",
    "publisher announces for each file. Raising a version means changing the version, the urls and the",
    "hashes together; tools/test-installer.js checks the shape. These are single binaries: they go to",
    "<data dir>/tools/bin, need no installer and no elevated rights."
  ],
